{
  "about": "A device that takes its time to start (docs/design/voice-notes.md §8, §9; PR 340's review): the module answers Start and Play at once and starts the device on a thread of its own, so the message row shows \"Starting the microphone…\" with Stop and Discard, no time and no level, until voice_status says recording; Stop then records nothing, the banner goes and the room says so: voice_status moved to idle because of that Stop, so its answer follows it there, whether the move comes first (the first Stop) or the answer does (the second); a start past the module's 15 s bound, or one that failed on its thread, ends idle with recording.error and ready.capture saying why, in words; a note's card says \"Starting…\" until its speaker runs, and a speaker start too slow says so. voiceJson and voiceResultJson are copied from the shapes voice_status and the voice methods pin (voice_live_test §29, §29b, §29d, §30: while a start is on its way, ready says unknown for its device), not recorded (§15).",
